        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: John Spalvins, Janis Gunnars Spalvins\n- Companies: Adelaide Steamship Company\n- Places: Latvia, South Australia\n- Roles: Managing Director\n\nFacts:\n- The Adelaide Steamship Company was formed in 1875 by a group of South Australian businessmen.\n- John Spalvins, born Janis Gunnars Spalvins, was born in Latvia in 1936.\n- John Spalvins served as Managing Director of the Adelaide Steamship Company from 1977 until the company's collapse in 1991.\n- The Adelaide Steamship Company collapsed in 1991.",
